{
  "name" : "Wang2019 - A mathematical model of oncolytic virotherapy with time delay",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2/version4\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">        <pre>A mathematical model describing oncolytic virotherapy with incorporation the viral lytic cycle and the virus-specific CTL response. The thresholds for viral treatment and virus-specific CTl response are also obtained.</pre>      </body>    </notes>",
  "format" : {
